These two classes use `Restrictions.and(Restrictions.eq(...), Restrictions.eq(...))` passed to `findByCriteria`. Migrate to QueryRestriction lambdas:

WmsRequestInterceptor:
```java
QueryRestriction<ImageWmsLayerDataSource> where = (root, query, cb) -> cb.and(
    cb.equal(root.get("requestableByPath"), true),
    cb.equal(root.get("customRequestPath"), endpoint)
);
List<ImageWmsLayerDataSource> sources = this.layerDataSourceDao.findByCriteria(where);
```

WmsResponseInterceptor: same pattern.

